  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 510.01 Definitions. “Residence” means a structure serving as a dwelling or home, in which a person(s) lives or resides but does not include any locations licensed by the commission.\n\nSource. #10742, eff 12-10-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
